1
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,780
The rain is so heavy, let's find a place to hide from the rain.

2
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:19,369
OK. OK.

3
00:01:29,373 --> 00:01:30,180
Why is it raining suddenly?

4
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,660
Yes, it's raining. It's not small at all.

5
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:39,300
The clothes are wet. Fortunately, there's a temple here.

6
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:49,400
If this Bodhisattva was a real person, that would be great.

7
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:53,080
How can a Bodhisattva be a real person?

8
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:59,780
When there are so many beautiful women in the world, why do you have to have a daydream?

9
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:04,080
The rain has stopped, let's get on the road.

10
00:02:15,180 --> 00:02:17,420
Xu Gui, give me the brush.

11
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:21,220
Yes.

12
00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:44,550
The durian ripples, the gold ripples, who can wash my heart?

13
00:02:45,170 --> 00:02:50,070
If a fairy gives it to you, it will last forever.

14
00:03:51,782 --> 00:03:53,340
Yue Lang, why are you here as well?

15
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:57,500
There is a chance to meet a thousand miles away, but not here.

16
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:02,900
Don't be angry, look at this love story.

17
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,080
I don't want to look at it.

18
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:08,260
Marriage is not a child's play.

19
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:15,260
I'll read it to you.

20
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,700
How is it? Not bad, isn't it?

21
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,660
Sir

22
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:44,560
Under the light of the day, what are you doing here?

23
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:48,400
We are here to register.

24
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:51,940
This is not a inn, you've gone to the wrong place.

25
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:57,120
Sir, I'm Xu Yuan Ren, I'm here to take the exam.

26
00:04:58,780 --> 00:05:02,720
Oh, since it's the exam, I won't be late. Please pay.

27
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:08,240
Sir, your hall is empty.

28
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:11,020
Just let us stay here for a night.

29
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:12,780
Stay here for a night?

30
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:20,920
It's not a big deal, we can do it during the day, but not at night.

31
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,380
Why not?

32
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:30,200
My daughter has never met a man.

33
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:36,460
Nothing but eating and sleeping.

34
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,840
I'm not interested in anything.

35
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:41,220
I think you're a good guy.

36
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,180
This guy is...

37
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:57,370
Don't worry, I'm a scholar, I only want to get my name

38
00:05:57,370 --> 00:05:59,590
I don't have any other thoughts

39
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:05,190
But I'd like to ask you to go in and have a rest

40
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:07,810
It's a good deed

41
00:06:09,250 --> 00:06:13,610
That sounds good, but I don't know what you're thinking

42
00:06:13,610 --> 00:06:16,670
Forgive me for being bold

43
00:06:16,670 --> 00:06:19,010
even if it's a fairy, it can't touch my heart.

44
00:06:19,010 --> 00:06:23,710
You can't touch me even if you want to

45
00:06:23,710 --> 00:06:27,330
With your words, I'll let you go

46
00:06:27,330 --> 00:06:29,490
Have a rest

47
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:32,230
Thank you, sir

48
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:36,530
Be polite, there's a room next door

49
00:06:36,530 --> 00:06:38,050
Come with me

50
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:14,300
I've caught you this time

51
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,120
What else do you want to say?

52
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:20,060
Forgive me, sir, I didn't mean to

53
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:23,320
You broke into the girl's room for no reason

54
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:27,600
And you've forgotten what you said just now

55
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:31,340
I won't forgive you for being a hypocrite

56
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:36,780
Please forgive me, sir

57
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:38,400
Dad

58
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:43,860
This kind of person doesn't know anything

59
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,880
It's no use talking to you

60
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:48,360
Let's go to the yard

61
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:51,100
I can't do that

62
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:53,540
Please forgive me, sir

63
00:08:53,540 --> 00:08:54,240
Forgive you?

64
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:58,980
You're a man, you dare to do this?

65
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:03,240
Are you afraid that Zhang Yang will ruin your future?

66
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:07,620
Please forgive me, sir

67
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,880
Why did you have to do this?

68
00:09:12,460 --> 00:09:17,160
Please forgive me, sir

69
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:20,540
I forgive you this time

70
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:22,240
Get up

71
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,400
We're here to rent a room

72
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:30,740
Not at home, not in the inn

73
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,760
If you don't follow the rules, you'll be kicked out

74
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,900
There's no place to rest

75
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:38,060
Who are you talking to?

76
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:41,040
I'm talking to myself

77
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,180
I told you not to worry

78
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:47,420
Don't say that to me

79
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:49,220
Why?

80
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,240
You've forgotten about the fairy temple

81
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:59,040
That's a fairy, I was joking with her

82
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:01,080
I just don't dare

83
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,640
Then why did you go to someone else's room?

84
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,660
I don't know

85
00:10:08,660 --> 00:10:11,660
I think someone pushed me in

86
00:10:11,660 --> 00:10:13,160
You're the one with the feet

87
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,420
If you don't leave, will they be able to move?

88
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,180
That's strange

89
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:27,680
Right, unless we sleep together tonight

90
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,020
You were kneeling just now

91
00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:42,600
I can't run away from the monk

92
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:48,680
What I said was right

93
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:55,700
If it weren't for me, you'd have to kneel again

94
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:56,860
I was wronged

95
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:58,380
What wronged?

96
00:10:58,380 --> 00:11:01,160
You must have fallen in love with her

97
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:05,380
I was kneeling just like you

98
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:16,040
You're mistaken, I'm reading

99
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:34,420
Help

100
00:11:42,370 --> 00:11:44,130
Good boy

101
00:11:44,130 --> 00:11:47,450
Master, I didn't mean to do this

102
00:11:47,450 --> 00:11:49,630
You didn't mean to do this?

103
00:11:49,970 --> 00:11:51,330
Did my daughter send you here?

104
00:11:52,930 --> 00:11:55,390
No, my master sent me here

105
00:11:56,470 --> 00:11:59,970
I didn't mean to do this

106
00:11:59,970 --> 00:12:03,210
You'll have to kneel twice tonight

107
00:12:03,210 --> 00:12:05,130
Master, please spare me

108
00:12:06,170 --> 00:12:07,430
Spare you?

109
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:09,110
You're wronged again

110
00:12:09,110 --> 00:12:11,190
I'll have to take you to the government

111
00:12:11,190 --> 00:12:11,730
You can't go

112
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:14,410
It's a small matter

113
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:17,650
You can't send me to the government

114
00:12:17,650 --> 00:12:20,290
Forget it

115
00:12:20,970 --> 00:12:22,230
What do you mean?

116
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:23,530
Men and women don't get along

117
00:12:23,950 --> 00:12:26,170
I'm going to the government to sue

118
00:12:26,170 --> 00:12:29,610
Don't mind me

119
00:12:29,930 --> 00:12:33,650
Master, it's not easy for you to leave

120
00:12:33,650 --> 00:12:36,030
...

121
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:37,190
What if you die?

122
00:12:37,970 --> 00:12:39,130
What?

123
00:12:40,170 --> 00:12:42,150
You're cursing me before I die?

124
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:45,290
Do you want to take my daughter away?

125
00:12:45,870 --> 00:12:46,770
Let's go

126
00:12:46,770 --> 00:12:50,450
Master, it's him, not me

127
00:12:55,410 --> 00:12:58,630
Master, please spare me

128
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:01,280
I'll listen to you

129
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:05,130
It's not that cheap

130
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,570
I'm so angry

131
00:13:12,410 --> 00:13:16,590
Father, please spare him

132
00:13:16,590 --> 00:13:22,530
What? You're speaking for him too?

133
00:13:25,170 --> 00:13:26,990
So you two have agreed

134
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:19,860
Come, sit down

135
00:14:19,860 --> 00:14:25,340
You too

136
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:45,080
Today is a good day

137
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:47,240
Let's have a good drink

138
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,200
Cheers

139
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:11,560
I'm sorry

140
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:15,080
Xu Gui, this is a good time

141
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:19,300
It's a good time to drink

142
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:22,040
Drink

143
00:16:09,070 --> 00:16:10,130
Master

144
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:21,810
Master

145
00:16:21,810 --> 00:16:26,030
I, Xu Gui, am not drunk

146
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:32,870
I've never made you drink so much

147
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:34,550
I'll give you a drink

148
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:52,810
Master

149
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:18,380
Xu Gui

150
00:17:47,780 --> 00:17:49,780
Xu Gui

151
00:17:54,670 --> 00:17:57,930
Xu Gui, why are you sleeping here?

152
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:17,950
Father

153
00:18:21,470 --> 00:18:23,610
Your son-in-law is half a son

154
00:18:23,610 --> 00:18:27,970
Why is your daughter seeing a stranger?

155
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:32,050
Father

156
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:38,590
My wife

157
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:41,630
My husband

158
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:48,880
Today is our wedding day

159
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,360
Why are you sighing?

160
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,840
My husband, you don't know

161
00:18:54,730 --> 00:18:57,100
I'm just...

162
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:58,320
You're just an ordinary woman

163
00:19:00,850 --> 00:19:02,580
No matter how ordinary you are

164
00:19:02,690 --> 00:19:04,460
I only love you

165
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,900
Oh my God

166
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,800
What am I going to say?

167
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,920
Don't say anything

168
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:13,200
Now that we're married

169
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:20,440
I'll come back to pick you up

170
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,640
"At that time...

171
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:23,180
"...We were in love..."

172
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:24,640
"...We were close..."

173
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:28,440
"...We were rich..."

174
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:32,760
Enough, don't say any more

175
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:34,140
What?

176
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:38,820
The more you say, the more I feel sad

177
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,160
Because I'm going to the exam?

178
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:45,640
How can you leave me?

179
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:50,500
Don't you want fame and wealth?

180
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,040
I'm just a poor woman

181
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:58,160
I don't have the fortune to enjoy this fame

182
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,940
If that's the case

183
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:04,200
Why should I go to the exam?

184
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:09,440
I don't want fame or wealth

185
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,480
I only want you

186
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:17,360
As long as you're with me

187
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,540
We'll be together forever

188
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:22,020
From old age to death

189
00:20:22,020 --> 00:20:25,040
Even if I don't have fame or wealth

190
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:32,560
I'm willing to do it

191
00:21:07,450 --> 00:21:08,670
Look

192
00:21:11,850 --> 00:21:14,900
How happy they are together

193
00:21:16,170 --> 00:21:18,310
They're just a couple

194
00:21:18,310 --> 00:21:20,510
They won't last long

195
00:21:21,030 --> 00:21:22,990
We're a loving couple

196
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:30,050
We'll be happier than them

197
00:21:30,050 --> 00:21:31,510
I hope so

198
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:48,240
Dad, I don't want to go to the exam

199
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:51,880
I want to be with my wife forever

200
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:52,920
How can that be?

201
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:55,480
You made me suffer

202
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,020
I mean

203
00:22:00,020 --> 00:22:03,380
Men should value fame and wealth

204
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:09,500
How can they be so short-sighted?

205
00:22:09,620 --> 00:22:11,500
I'm leaving

206
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:15,780
Take good care of your father

207
00:22:15,780 --> 00:22:17,360
My husband

208
00:22:21,050 --> 00:22:23,150
I'll be back when I have fame

209
00:22:24,290 --> 00:22:26,370
Don't cry

210
00:22:27,210 --> 00:22:28,890
Silly woman

211
00:22:28,890 --> 00:22:31,470
Sir, can we not leave?

212
00:22:33,410 --> 00:22:36,210
If I can stay with my wife forever

213
00:22:36,930 --> 00:22:38,510
Even if I have to stay here forever

214
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:40,690
I'm willing to

215
00:22:40,690 --> 00:22:41,830
Then let's not leave

216
00:22:45,370 --> 00:22:47,490
My wife

217
00:22:47,490 --> 00:22:49,400
Your future is important

218
00:22:49,830 --> 00:22:53,050
I should encourage you to seek fame

219
00:22:53,050 --> 00:22:55,470
I shouldn't hinder your future

220
00:23:01,610 --> 00:23:03,930
My husband

221
00:23:03,930 --> 00:23:06,090
My wife

222
00:23:06,090 --> 00:23:09,060
There's no such thing as a never-ending feast

223
00:23:09,590 --> 00:23:11,190
You can't escape from it

224
00:23:11,190 --> 00:23:12,310
You can't stay

225
00:23:13,650 --> 00:23:15,770
Even if you're an immortal

226
00:23:15,770 --> 00:23:17,670
You can't just stay

227
00:23:17,670 --> 00:23:19,830
You're right

228
00:23:20,670 --> 00:23:22,810
You should seek fame

229
00:23:22,810 --> 00:23:26,630
I shouldn't hinder our future

230
00:23:26,630 --> 00:23:27,730
My wife

231
00:23:28,410 --> 00:23:31,190
I'll never forget you

232
00:23:31,190 --> 00:23:34,010
We have to say goodbye

233
00:23:34,010 --> 00:23:40,010
Let's go

234
00:23:40,010 --> 00:23:40,730
Yes

235
00:23:54,230 --> 00:25:33,617
Brother-in-law, you're here

236
00:25:33,617 --> 00:25:33,650
Brother-in-law
Brother-in-law, you're here

237
00:25:33,650 --> 00:25:35,000
Brother-in-law, you're here

238
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,140
That's great

239
00:25:36,980 --> 00:25:39,060
Hsuan, be polite

240
00:25:39,620 --> 00:25:41,360
Don't touch my wife

241
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:43,620
I'm calling you brother-in-law

242
00:25:43,620 --> 00:25:44,680
It's my honor

243
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:52,080
Otherwise, you're going to be a father

244
00:25:52,740 --> 00:25:54,520
What did you say?

245
00:25:56,220 --> 00:26:02,100
If you don't believe me, go and see for yourself

246
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:11,930
Let's go

247
00:26:33,830 --> 00:26:35,930
How dare you talk to me

248
00:26:37,610 --> 00:26:39,050
You bitch

249
00:26:39,050 --> 00:26:41,270
If I don't kill you today

250
00:26:41,270 --> 00:26:43,310
You won't know how much I hate you

251
00:26:44,450 --> 00:26:45,890
Husband

252
00:26:45,890 --> 00:26:47,090
Please listen to me

253
00:26:47,090 --> 00:26:49,330
It's because the old man took out the marriage certificate

254
00:26:49,330 --> 00:26:52,170
He said that Xu Yun-rui and I have a father-in-law

255
00:26:52,170 --> 00:26:53,590
So...

256
00:26:53,590 --> 00:26:54,030
What?

257
00:26:56,330 --> 00:26:58,350
So I promised him

258
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:04,350
So it was the old fool's bad idea

259
00:27:05,090 --> 00:27:07,590
And the old man's bad idea

260
00:27:07,590 --> 00:27:09,390
Now it's all over

261
00:27:10,770 --> 00:27:12,290
I'll go to the old fool

262
00:27:17,130 --> 00:27:17,770
Wait

263
00:27:17,770 --> 00:27:20,210
I don't dare to bother you

264
00:27:20,210 --> 00:27:22,170
I'll do it myself

265
00:27:22,170 --> 00:27:24,090
You're so stubborn

266
00:27:27,090 --> 00:27:28,610
Please calm down

267
00:27:30,130 --> 00:27:31,650
It clearly says

268
00:27:31,650 --> 00:27:33,790
Xu Yun-rui will marry the fairy

269
00:27:35,630 --> 00:27:36,190
Look

270
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,960
You old fool

271
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:50,160
...

272
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:52,400
Why did you say Xu Yun-rui will marry the fairy?

273
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:54,120
Look

274
00:27:59,430 --> 00:28:00,730
It's the fairy

275
00:28:00,730 --> 00:28:02,070
How can it be the fairy?

276
00:28:05,390 --> 00:28:09,970
It turns out that this is a dead ant

277
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:13,150
Ridiculous

278
00:28:13,150 --> 00:28:17,930
I deserve to die

279
00:28:17,930 --> 00:28:20,210
Please forgive me

280
00:28:20,210 --> 00:28:21,890
It's all my fault

281
00:28:21,890 --> 00:28:23,710
It's not your fault

282
00:28:23,710 --> 00:28:25,430
Stand away from me

283
00:28:25,430 --> 00:28:27,090
Don't make me angry

284
00:28:27,090 --> 00:28:28,630
The imperial edict has arrived

285
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:48,000
There is a fairy

286
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:50,280
She is not a fairy

287
00:28:50,280 --> 00:28:52,200
