01:05:43,500 --> 01:05:44,920
Please be kind, Great Sage

594
01:05:44,920 --> 01:05:46,060
No

595
01:05:46,060 --> 01:05:48,300
The fairy has broken the heaven rule

596
01:05:48,300 --> 01:05:49,640
If it wasn't for me

597
01:05:49,640 --> 01:05:53,260
She would have run amok

598
01:05:53,260 --> 01:05:54,680
What?

599
01:05:55,300 --> 01:05:56,680
My mother was trapped by you?

600
01:05:58,500 --> 01:05:59,380
Exactly

601
01:05:59,380 --> 01:06:48,440
Let's go

602
01:07:28,300 --> 01:07:31,120
...

603
01:07:31,180 --> 01:07:31,780
[monkey noises]

604
01:07:38,060 --> 01:07:40,440
[boy noises]

605
01:08:07,250 --> 01:08:09,610
[monkey noises]

606
01:08:51,970 --> 01:08:52,970
Hey

607
01:08:52,970 --> 01:08:53,110
Be good

608
01:08:53,110 --> 01:08:55,650
When I find my mother

609
01:08:55,650 --> 01:08:57,070
I'll let you out

610
01:08:58,990 --> 01:09:01,990
I'm so cold

611
01:09:01,990 --> 01:09:02,790
Monkey

612
01:09:02,790 --> 01:09:04,070
Where is my mother?

613
01:09:05,070 --> 01:09:07,050
In the stone cave

614
01:09:09,370 --> 01:09:10,370
Okay

615
01:09:10,370 --> 01:09:11,750
I'll let you out

616
01:09:25,670 --> 01:09:28,750
Mother

617
01:09:31,890 --> 01:09:34,770
Mother

618
01:09:34,770 --> 01:09:38,250
Mother, it's me

619
01:09:39,270 --> 01:09:40,430
Mother

620
01:09:40,890 --> 01:09:41,590
Child

621
01:09:41,590 --> 01:09:43,270
Mother

622
01:09:43,270 --> 01:09:47,070
I thought I'd never see you again

623
01:09:47,070 --> 01:09:48,050
Child

624
01:09:48,050 --> 01:09:50,110
Mother, I miss you

625
01:09:50,110 --> 01:09:51,850
I want to be with you forever

626
01:09:51,850 --> 01:09:53,230
I won't leave you

627
01:09:54,490 --> 01:09:55,070
Child

628
01:09:57,050 --> 01:09:58,990
I've broken the heaven rule

629
01:09:58,990 --> 01:10:03,890
I will be locked in the cave forever

630
01:10:03,890 --> 01:10:05,050
Child

631
01:10:09,420 --> 01:10:11,080
I want to get you out

632
01:10:11,080 --> 01:10:11,900
Mother

633
01:10:13,060 --> 01:10:16,080
No, you can't

634
01:10:16,080 --> 01:10:17,580
No matter what

635
01:10:17,580 --> 01:10:19,280
I'm willing to bear the consequences

636
01:10:19,280 --> 01:10:21,860
No, child

637
01:10:22,040 --> 01:10:27,620
You can't

638
01:10:31,400 --> 01:10:33,620
Listen to me

639
01:10:33,620 --> 01:10:36,180
You can't

640
01:10:41,300 --> 01:10:41,980
Master

641
01:10:48,180 --> 01:10:50,440
Mother, please step back

642
01:10:50,440 --> 01:10:52,440
I want to use this treasure box

643
01:10:52,440 --> 01:10:53,420
Open the cave

644
01:10:54,230 --> 01:10:55,260
No, child

645
01:10:55,260 --> 01:10:58,120
You can't

646
01:11:21,370 --> 01:11:21,990
Mother

647
01:11:49,480 --> 01:11:50,660
Where are you from?

648
01:11:51,200 --> 01:11:53,180
How dare you break the cave and kidnap the fairy

649
01:11:54,010 --> 01:11:55,440
The fairy is my mother

650
01:11:55,440 --> 01:11:56,060
Who are you?

651
01:11:57,780 --> 01:12:00,220
Don't be rude

652
01:12:00,220 --> 01:12:02,100
Child, he's your uncle

653
01:12:02,100 --> 01:12:03,240
Call him

654
01:12:03,240 --> 01:12:05,760
Come on

655
01:12:05,760 --> 01:12:06,120
Uncle

656
01:12:06,120 --> 01:12:07,760
Easy

657
01:12:07,760 --> 01:12:10,500
Call me uncle?

658
01:12:10,500 --> 01:12:12,800
Take him away

659
01:12:12,800 --> 01:12:14,120
No

660
01:12:15,240 --> 01:12:17,860
So you won't let my mother go

661
01:12:17,860 --> 01:12:19,020
Child

662
01:12:20,220 --> 01:12:21,980
You're my nephew

663
01:12:23,120 --> 01:12:25,320
If you can beat me

664
01:12:25,320 --> 01:12:27,180
I'll let you go

665
01:12:27,180 --> 01:12:28,960
Come on

666
01:12:28,960 --> 01:12:29,820
In order to save my mother

667
01:12:30,820 --> 01:12:31,440
I have to be polite

668
01:12:31,440 --> 01:12:34,620
Don't hit him

669
01:12:38,200 --> 01:12:42,360
Thank you

670
01:12:42,360 --> 01:12:44,760
Mother, let's go

671
01:12:47,060 --> 01:12:48,300
Child

672
01:15:16,020 --> 01:15:17,200
Son

673
01:15:17,200 --> 01:15:17,720
Your filial piety

674
01:15:18,500 --> 01:15:21,160
The heaven and earth

675
01:15:21,160 --> 01:15:22,340
Have given birth to your mother

676
01:15:22,340 --> 01:15:25,000
From now on

677
01:15:25,000 --> 01:15:26,910
I can live a free life

678
01:15:28,060 --> 01:15:29,240
As a fairy

679
01:15:29,240 --> 01:15:29,720
Child

680
01:15:30,500 --> 01:15:32,980
If you really love me

681
01:15:32,980 --> 01:15:35,240
You should listen to me

682
01:15:35,240 --> 01:15:37,140
Go back

683
01:15:37,140 --> 01:15:38,700
Be good to your parents

684
01:15:38,700 --> 01:15:41,420
And love your poor brother

685
01:15:41,420 --> 01:15:42,480
No

686
01:15:42,480 --> 01:15:46,230
Mother, I want to be with you

687
01:15:46,230 --> 01:15:47,150
Mother

688
01:15:48,250 --> 01:15:48,910
Child

689
01:15:49,910 --> 01:15:52,010
I love you

690
01:15:52,010 --> 01:15:54,670
But I can't be with you

691
01:15:55,050 --> 01:15:55,970
Mother

692
01:15:55,970 --> 01:15:56,670
Why?

693
01:15:58,590 --> 01:16:00,050
Go back

694
01:16:00,050 --> 01:16:01,330
Child

695
01:16:01,330 --> 01:16:03,030
Son

696
01:16:03,030 --> 01:16:05,610
I'll always remember you as a filial child

697
01:16:07,290 --> 01:16:09,850
I'll always

698
01:16:09,850 --> 01:16:11,530
Bless you

699
01:16:11,530 --> 01:16:12,550
Mother

700
01:16:13,330 --> 01:16:13,970
Mother

701
01:16:58,520 --> 01:17:00,940
Are you Ping Yuan?

702
01:17:02,640 --> 01:17:03,200
Yes

703
01:17:04,480 --> 01:17:07,200
Brother, I'm Qing Shan

704
01:17:07,200 --> 01:17:08,740
You don't recognize me

705
01:17:12,720 --> 01:17:13,480
Nonsense

706
01:17:13,480 --> 01:17:15,400
How can you be my brother?

707
01:17:15,940 --> 01:17:16,880
Do you remember

708
01:17:16,880 --> 01:17:19,060
Qin's soldiers?

709
01:17:20,480 --> 01:17:22,140
In that hill

710
01:17:22,140 --> 01:17:23,260
You disappeared

711
01:17:26,380 --> 01:17:27,900
Maybe because the fairy...

712
01:17:30,380 --> 01:17:32,520
It's been more than ten years

713
01:17:33,260 --> 01:17:35,340
I've been hunting here for the rest of my life

714
01:17:35,340 --> 01:17:37,400
I believe my brother will come back

715
01:17:38,020 --> 01:17:42,920
Brother

716
01:17:44,680 --> 01:17:46,080
Brother

717
01:17:46,080 --> 01:17:56,890
Brother, let's go home

718
01:18:17,347 --> 01:18:17,670
Yuxing

719
01:18:33,570 --> 01:18:34,970
Master

720
01:18:36,850 --> 01:18:38,850
It's cold outside

721
01:18:38,850 --> 01:18:41,190
Let's go inside

722
01:18:55,420 --> 01:18:59,380
Ping Yuan

723
01:19:00,800 --> 01:19:01,500
Master

724
01:19:05,060 --> 01:19:06,460
Brother

725
01:19:07,380 --> 01:19:09,240
Brother

726
01:19:11,220 --> 01:19:12,300
Let's go home

727
01:19:15,380 --> 01:19:29,720
Let's all go home

